# Production build settings for the storefront.
#
# Committed on purpose: these are public URLs, not secrets. Vite inlines anything
# prefixed VITE_ into the bundle, so a secret here would be served to every visitor.
#
# The variable is VITE_API_BASE, and it includes the /api path — the code appends route
# names straight onto it. VITE_API_URL is not read by anything and would be ignored.
VITE_API_BASE=https://api.aarunyajewelsbyveena.in/api
